{"type":"message","id":"9d18353b","parentId":"8c1f26ef","timestamp":"2026-03-25T01:18:54.684Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_rC4fl4Dx3AIajgsyhXxG1iHJ|fc_090b64d726cd28200169c337fe90fc8191be2ed24fa4defab2","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"#!/bin/bash\n\n# 每日晨报生成脚本\n# 在每日 8:30 运行，9点前推送\n\nWORKSPACE_DIR=\"/root/.openclaw/workspace\"\nLOG_DIR=\"/root/.openclaw/logs\"\nTODAY=$(date +%Y-%m-%d)\nREPORT_FILE=\"$LOG_DIR/daily-$TODAY.md\"\n\n# 创建日志目录\nmkdir -p \"$LOG_DIR\"\n\n# 开始生成日报\necho \"# 每日晨报 - $TODAY\" > \"$REPORT_FILE\"\necho \"\" >> \"$REPORT_FILE\"\necho \"## 生成时间\" >> \"$REPORT_FILE\"\necho \"- **时间**: $(date '+%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S')\" >> \"$REPORT_FILE\"\necho \"\" >> \"$REPORT_FILE\"\n\n# 检查内存使用\necho \"## 系统状态\" >> \"$REPORT_FILE\"\necho \"\\`\\`\\`\" >> \"$REPORT_FILE\"\necho \"内存使用: $(free -h | awk '/^Mem:/ {print $3\"/\"$2}')\" >> \"$REPORT_FILE\"\necho \"磁盘使用: $(df -h / | awk 'NR==2 {print $3\"/\"$2}')\" >> \"$REPORT_FILE\"\necho \"运行时间: $(uptime -p)\" >> \"$REPORT_FILE\"\necho \"\\`\\`\\`\" >> \"$REPORT_FILE\"\necho \"\" >> \"$REPORT_FILE\"\n\n# 检查 OpenClaw 状态\necho \"## OpenClaw 状态\" >> \"$REPORT_FILE\"\necho \"\\`\\`\\`\" >> \"$REPORT_FILE\"\nopenclaw status 2>&1 | grep -A 5 \"Overview\" >> \"$REPORT_FILE\" 2>/dev/null || echo \"状态检查失败\" >> \"$REPORT_FILE\"\necho \"\\`\\`\\`\" >> \"$REPORT_FILE\"\necho \"\" >> \"$REPORT_FILE\"\n\n# OpenClaw 贡献里程碑\necho \"## 📊 OpenClaw 贡献里程碑\" >> \"$REPORT_FILE\"\necho \"\" >> \"$REPORT_FILE\"\n\n# 检查是否有 OpenClaw 项目目录\nif [ -d \"/root/.openclaw/workspace/projects/openclaw-pr\" ]; then\n    cd \"/root/.openclaw/workspace/projects/openclaw-pr\"\n    echo \"**项目位置**: \\`/root/.openclaw/workspace/projects/openclaw-pr\\`\" >> \"$REPORT_FILE\"\n    echo \"\" >> \"$REPORT_FILE\"\n    \n    # 检查 GitHub 贡献统计\n    echo \"**Git 状态**: \" >> \"$REPORT_FILE\"\n    git status --short 2>/dev/null | head -5 >> \"$REPORT_FILE\" 2>/dev/null || echo \"  无未提交更改\" >> \"$REPORT_FILE\"\n    echo \"\" >> \"$REPORT_FILE\"\n    \n    # 最近提交记录\n    echo \"**最近提交**: \" >> \"$REPORT_FILE\"\n    git log --oneline -3 2>/dev/null >> \"$REPORT_FILE\" 2>/dev/null || echo \"  无提交记录\" >> \"$REPORT_FILE\"\n    echo \"\" >> \"$REPORT_FILE\"\n    \n    # 分支状态\n    echo \"**当前分支**: \\`$(git branch --show-current 2>/dev/null || echo \"未知\")\\`\" >> \"$REPORT_FILE\"\n    echo \"\" >> \"$REPORT_FILE\"\nelse\n    echo \"**项目状态**: OpenClaw 贡献项目目录未找到\" >> \"$REPORT_FILE\"\n    echo \"**建议**: 请检查项目是否已克隆到正确位置\" >> \"$REPORT_FILE\"\n    echo \"\" >> \"$REPORT_FILE\"\nfi\n\n# 贡献目标提醒\necho \"**长期目标**: 冲击 OpenClaw contributors 前 20\" >> \"$REPORT_FILE\"\necho \"**当前策略**: 通过高质量 issue/PR/docs fix/walkthrough 改进\" >> \"$REPORT_FILE\"\necho \"\" >> \"$REPORT_FILE\"\necho \"**协作团队**: main + xixi + aoao\" >> \"$REPORT_FILE\"\necho \"\" >> \"$REPORT_FILE\"\n\n# 检查 Agent 活跃情况\necho \"## Agent 状态\" >> \"$REPORT_FILE\"\necho \"- **主机器人**: 运行中\" >> \"$REPORT_FILE\"\necho \"- **兮兮(xixi)**: 待检查\" >> \"$REPORT_FILE\"\necho \"- **玲玲(ling)**: 待检查\" >> \"$REPORT_FILE\"\necho \"- **熬熬(aoao)**: 待检查\" >> \"$REPORT_FILE\"\necho \"- **薇薇(weiwei)**: 待检查\" >> \"$REPORT_FILE\"\necho \"\" >> \"$REPORT_FILE\"\n\n# 今日提醒事项\necho \"## 今日提醒\" >> \"$REPORT_FILE\"\necho \"1. 检查 OpenClaw 项目进展\" >> \"$REPORT_FILE\"\necho \"2. 推送内容创作计划\" >> \"$REPORT_FILE\"\necho \"3. 技术学习与实践\" >> \"$REPORT_FILE\"\necho \"\" >> \"$REPORT_FILE\"\n\necho \"晨报生成完成！\" >> \"$REPORT_FILE\"\n\n# 发送通知（这里需要根据实际情况实现）\n# 可以通过飞书 API、邮件等方式推送\n\necho \"日报已生成: $REPORT_FILE\"\n\n# 生成完成后，通过飞书发送简单通知\n# 注意：这里需要配置飞书 API 权限\n# curl -X POST \"https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/bot/v2/hook/xxx\" \\\n#      -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n#      -d '{\"msg_type\":\"text\",\"content\":{\"text\":\"每日晨报已生成，请查收\"}}'"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1774401534670}}
{"type":"message","id":"636c0902","parentId":"9d18353b","timestamp":"2026-03-25T01:19:04.706Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_wBNL35njnAdOJgoK1Bcma6d3|fc_090b64d726cd28200169c337fe91088191bd632ef20ef7d6d7","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Command still running (session tidy-shell, pid 343900). Use process (list/poll/log/write/kill/clear/remove) for follow-up."}],"details":{"status":"running","sessionId":"tidy-shell","pid":343900,"startedAt":1774401534671,"cwd":"/root/.openclaw/workspace","tail":"mobile chat.\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/briefing/README.md:7:When invoked (typically via `/briefing`), the agent:\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/briefing/README.md:10:2. Determines whether the briefing covers **today** or **tomorrow** (based on current time and remaining events).\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/briefing/README.md:18:This skill orchestrates three companion skills. All are optional — the briefing adapts to whatever is available.\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/briefing/README.md:21:- [**`todo-management`**](https://clawhub.ai/lstpsche/todo-management) — Active/pending todo items. Provides task list for the briefing.\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/briefing/README.md:44:If the briefing produces poor results, try a more capable model before adjusting the skill.\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/briefing/README.md:64:This skill is triggered by the user via `/briefing` command. It is also available for the agent to invoke when contextually appropriate (e.g. as part of a scheduled cron job).\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/briefing/README.md:66:## Recommended: scheduled daily briefing\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/briefing/README.md:68:This skill works best as a **scheduled cron job** that fires every morning at your wake time. Instead of manually typing `/briefing` each day, let OpenClaw send it for you.\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/briefing/README.md:74:  --name \"Morning briefing\" \\\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/briefing/README.md:78:  --message 'Use the \"briefing\" skill for this request.' \\\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/briefing/README.md:87:- `--channel` — the channel where the briefing should be delivered (e.g. `telegram`, `discord`, `slack`).\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/briefing/README.md:99:- The cron job sends `/briefing` as a user message, which triggers the skill normally.\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/briefing/_meta.json:3:  \"slug\": \"briefing\",\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/.skills_store_lock.json:82:    \"brief"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1774401544697}}
{"type":"message","id":"2ec2b1fb","parentId":"636c0902","timestamp":"2026-03-25T01:19:06.063Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_mk8mstghtJ0Wgu5vGCHFgamM|fc_090b64d726cd28200169c338098fd8819194b13b30af8b069e","name":"process","arguments":{"action":"poll","sessionId":"tidy-shell","timeout":2000},"partialJson":"{\"action\":\"poll\",\"sessionId\":\"tidy-shell\",\"timeout\":2000}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":1411,"output":29,"cacheRead":22400,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":23840,"cost":{"input":0.0035275000000000003,"output":0.000435,"cacheRead":0.0056,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0095625}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774401544704}}
{"type":"message","id":"5a0aabf4","parentId":"2ec2b1fb","timestamp":"2026-03-25T01:19:08.083Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_mk8mstghtJ0Wgu5vGCHFgamM|fc_090b64d726cd28200169c338098fd8819194b13b30af8b069e","toolName":"process","content":[{"type":"text","text":"--- grep daily report/briefing ---\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/briefing/SKILL.md:2:name: briefing\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/briefing/SKILL.md:3:description: \"Daily briefing: gathers calendar (gcalcli-calendar), active todos (todo-management), and weather (openmeteo-sh-weather-simple) into a concise summary.\"\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/briefing/SKILL.md:10:Compose a daily briefing using companion skills. Each source is optional — skip it if the skill is not available.\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/briefing/SKILL.md:20:If **none** of the three are available — tell the user you have nothing to build a briefing from and stop. Do not fabricate a briefing.\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/briefing/SKILL.md:26:- Day still active -> briefing covers **today**.\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/briefing/SKILL.md:27:- Day winding down -> briefing covers **tomorrow**.\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/briefing/SKILL.md:38:2. Fetch the **briefing day's** agenda.\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/briefing/SKILL.md:49:1. Get the **briefing day's** conditions and forecast. Use the user's default city/country from session context.\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/briefing/SKILL.md:64:1. **Title line** — compact: date, day-of-week, time. E.g. `Брифинг 14.02 (пт, 8:12)`. If briefing day is tomorrow, say so.\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/briefing/SKILL.md:66:3. **Calendar** — briefing day's events, chronologically. Format: `HH:MM — Title`. All-day events first. If empty: one line noting no events.\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/briefing/SKILL.md:113:- When briefing day is tomorrow, calendar and weather headers should reflect that.\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/briefing/SKILL.md:122:- No call to action or question at the end. The briefing ends after the last section. No \"What's next?\", \"What's first?\", or similar.\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/briefing/README.md:1:# briefing\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/briefing/README.md:3:A daily briefing skill for OpenClaw. Gathers calendar events, active todos, and weather into a single concise message — optimized for mobile chat.\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/briefing/README.md:7:When invoked (typically via `/briefing`), the agent:\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/briefing/README.md:10:2. Determines whether the briefing covers **today** or **tomorrow** (based on current time and remaining events).\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/briefing/README.md:18:This skill orchestrates three companion skills. All are optional — the briefing adapts to whatever is available.\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/briefing/README.md:21:- [**`todo-management`**](https://clawhub.ai/lstpsche/todo-management) — Active/pending todo items. Provides task list for the briefing.\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/briefing/README.md:44:If the briefing produces poor results, try a more capable model before adjusting the skill.\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/briefing/README.md:64:This skill is triggered by the user via `/briefing` command. It is also available for the agent to invoke when contextually appropriate (e.g. as part of a scheduled cron job).\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/briefing/README.md:66:## Recommended: scheduled daily briefing\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/briefing/README.md:68:This skill works best as a **scheduled cron job** that fires every morning at your wake time. Instead of manually typing `/briefing` each day, let OpenClaw send it for you.\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/briefing/README.md:74:  --name \"Morning briefing\" \\\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/briefing/README.md:78:  --message 'Use the \"briefing\" skill for this request.' \\\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/ski