{"type":"message","id":"9f767788","parentId":"21ef86e6","timestamp":"2026-03-25T01:19:43.576Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Inspecting cron jobs**\n\nThe user mentioned an interesting cron that isn't configured, which is causing a delay. I need to see if perhaps the last run failed—maybe around 8 AM? It feels crucial to gather more details about the cron jobs. I'm considering if it might be configured to send the wrong message. To investigate further, I could use a command like `openclaw cron get`. I definitely need some help with this!","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_090b64d726cd28200169c3382a042c81919d9852aa3c2f2803\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABpwzgsJMRBruOzYN9httFseViYIxO08yL8oKUncPS5-86UJkEow-jwmIjSh1zAspBoIRyBKhjjG22HDTpUU0K2-3kG-FAL193v2veibQklmXqTLMS2gKRx6zl9Av38XHrwWzDZKelQ4xUmFdgtn8kGSzi0h5NRTgdjFdAlHW6qSr36M_4X0sFn53HQvgcC-Yr4UzHlCRcsMdBQ6LBtmmAJ6RAsx6a8oH3gzKo6kTZ3WZEqxz2bkASJdZmohdmMKxMB5LlfZYJ1mTxv6W2K3b_peV0RbgKkSGSqB9yvVlaEAJ8guaPzkoa5JOX9QVtsp3XDHUcNuMTzoB6zozQ_dNPyLNdT0J8uFoGYpRgfgAD0SORNcdeAqkuRM4ULW3T20BGk1ML571QmlZrTesGqWub63ZJ5HCpHpUatrJSevD5uD01I5hpP66s91V-Nzl_e-cJmzQCbVeGq6PxWYRpgPvhPmEBss6kmW1fXV891nXOVwa6ngchKW3430Vq4gZk7sdFwZ5bEkpr3UXtqHKtSSL8NABhkohdGJm6XRsheMd0gM5yCli8cZanKnQrSLY5fa7qeYldRJOxWxOLxqPTq_iYef0TEkFIWG-BdAajY5qoFMvZlmtJLqfQ6Y0G2c2blcDk1Em-UXyzxg4yzCfVy0lcs0Y7g7H9xgD_GYgxC1EIu4J9Fxa1wskAXMwSqXG2fejT5N8OolfNHR8v_jm1_8iUqdnx0Qzqz1MJyNt0vQX-cBVaFrR-uw_6vY-_F71I4O7D6mtahI0Zd6wD-hiY63SUETo6JCV3afDEB-fV__ImKvrs7uo_C-9lO9oC81QfncthymeiE9LdQSMDXKPEgbgJ9lF1Nf84g4tnfuga2MnBqJXFwN1rC8vXZ4CEsGSHkskDqPWooKfRXa9vS15ixqvcGy99zUatW0yio8irlgEhsExc2vnAC2I5IUopZCXEXbXogBcDI--8a_fHBE8qc37G9cnsQCeYd6xbXFZiWrCinekjKZlP7T69m7hBK4Tbb-Q6t34je2WP6XgeJfRzHiaTXjL9j2rsimfgToHwB6vswKrBRkUfleUlIbCHAUzK8naC0WEMKP_TPnVXylp7KGoSfcCbOYbRVSxTDBMV3yharhATpz8w=\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Inspecting cron jobs**\\n\\nThe user mentioned an interesting cron that isn't configured, which is causing a delay. I need to see if perhaps the last run failed—maybe around 8 AM? It feels crucial to gather more details about the cron jobs. I'm considering if it might be configured to send the wrong message. To investigate further, I could use a command like `openclaw cron get`. I definitely need some help with this!\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"我又确认了一层：**晨报 cron 其实已经存在**，不是“完全没配置”，而是**配置质量不对 / 触发内容不对**，所以表现出来像没配好。\n\n现状：\n- `morning-briefing` 已存在，8:00 Asia/Shanghai 触发\n- 但 workspace 里还有一个单独的 `scripts/generate-daily-report.sh`，两套方案并行、职责重叠，已经开始互相打架\n- 这就是现在“日报延迟、状态混乱”的根因之一\n\n我继续把这俩统一掉：保留一种可靠方案，不再双轨。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_090b64d726cd28200169c3382cc7e4819192c819c950476a65\",\"phase\":\"commentary\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_mCFkDCcplKebdvCbiygzMk5V|fc_090b64d726cd28200169c3382edfa48191b0a80cc386f064f9","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"openclaw cron --help || openclaw help cron || true","workdir":"/root/.openclaw/workspace","yieldMs":10000},"partialJson":"{\"command\":\"openclaw cron --help || openclaw help cron || true\",\"workdir\":\"/root/.openclaw/workspace\",\"yieldMs\":10000}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":33143,"output":254,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":33397,"cost":{"input":0.0828575,"output":0.00381,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0866675}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774401576607}}
{"type":"message","id":"1057d107","parentId":"9f767788","timestamp":"2026-03-25T01:19:46.894Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_mCFkDCcplKebdvCbiygzMk5V|fc_090b64d726cd28200169c3382edfa48191b0a80cc386f064f9","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"🦞 OpenClaw 2026.3.11 (29dc654) — Say \"stop\" and I'll stop—say \"ship\" and we'll both learn a lesson.\n\nUsage: openclaw cron [options] [command]\n\nManage cron jobs (via Gateway)\n\nOptions:\n  -h, --help  Display help for command\n\nCommands:\n  add         Add a cron job\n  disable     Disable a cron job\n  edit        Edit a cron job (patch fields)\n  enable      Enable a cron job\n  help        Display help for command\n  list        List cron jobs\n  rm          Remove a cron job\n  run         Run a cron job now (debug)\n  runs        Show cron run history (JSONL-backed)\n  status      Show cron scheduler status\n\nDocs: https://docs.openclaw.ai/cli/cron\nUpgrade tip: run `openclaw doctor --fix` to normalize legacy cron job storage."}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":3306,"aggregated":"🦞 OpenClaw 2026.3.11 (29dc654) — Say \"stop\" and I'll stop—say \"ship\" and we'll both learn a lesson.\n\nUsage: openclaw cron [options] [command]\n\nManage cron jobs (via Gateway)\n\nOptions:\n  -h, --help  Display help for command\n\nCommands:\n  add         Add a cron job\n  disable     Disable a cron job\n  edit        Edit a cron job (patch fields)\n  enable      Enable a cron job\n  help        Display help for command\n  list        List cron jobs\n  rm          Remove a cron job\n  run         Run a cron job now (debug)\n  runs        Show cron run history (JSONL-backed)\n  status      Show cron scheduler status\n\nDocs: https://docs.openclaw.ai/cli/cron\nUpgrade tip: run `openclaw doctor --fix` to normalize legacy cron job storage.","cwd":"/root/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1774401586884}}
