eep things tidy. However, the top-level repo will still show modifications if the nested repo has uncommitted changes, such as in package/SKILL. Maybe I should commit changes in the nested repo, especially if the user has added new files. I definitely need to inspect the diffs to ensure everything is clean and ready to go. I'll keep that in mind as I proceed!\"}]}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_SL76JJ87xbqJ6WbLnlXRS0L5|fc_090b64d726cd28200169c338716bb081919fc4a7a4019950df","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"git -C skills/xiaohongshu-cover-generator diff -- SKILL.md package.json | sed -n '1,220p'","workdir":"/root/.openclaw/workspace","yieldMs":10000},"partialJson":"{\"command\":\"git -C skills/xiaohongshu-cover-generator diff -- SKILL.md package.json | sed -n '1,220p'\",\"workdir\":\"/root/.openclaw/workspace\",\"yieldMs\":10000}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":205,"output":111,"cacheRead":44416,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":44732,"cost":{"input":0.0005125,"output":0.001665,"cacheRead":0.011104,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0132815}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774401645258}}
{"type":"message","id":"cb09c0ab","parentId":"6f5dc9ae","timestamp":"2026-03-25T01:20:49.732Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_SL76JJ87xbqJ6WbLnlXRS0L5|fc_090b64d726cd28200169c338716bb081919fc4a7a4019950df","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"diff --git a/SKILL.md b/SKILL.md\nindex 9b62c31..2037e85 100644\n--- a/SKILL.md\n+++ b/SKILL.md\n@@ -1,54 +1,124 @@\n ---\n name: xiaohongshu-cover-generator\n-description: Generate Xiaohongshu (小红书) style cover images based on user topics. Use when the user wants to create a social media cover image in Xiaohongshu style, or mentions keywords like \"小红书封面\", \"Xiaohongshu cover\", \"封面生成\", or provides a topic for cover image generation. The generated image will be saved to the current project directory.\n+description: 生成小红书风格封面图。支持两种生图方式：(1) Doubao Seedream 模型（需配置 Ark API），(2) 仓颉 API。用户可通过 --model 参数选择模型。当用户提到\"小红书封面\"\"配图生成\"\"封面图\"时触发。\n ---\n \n-# Xiaohongshu Cover Generator\n+# 小红书封面生成器\n \n-This skill generates Xiaohongshu-style cover images based on user-provided topics.\n+支持多种模型的 AI 封面图生成工具。\n \n-## Usage\n+## 使用方法\n \n-When a user requests a Xiaohongshu cover image:\n+```bash\n+# 进入技能目录\n+cd /root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/xiaohongshu-cover-generator\n+\n+# 生成封面图\n+python3 scripts/handler.py \"你的封面主题\" [选项]\n+```\n+\n+## 选项\n+\n+| 参数 | 简写 | 说明 | 默认值 |\n+|------|------|------|--------|\n+| `--model` | `-m` | 生图模型 | `doubao-seedream-5-0` |\n+| `--api-key` | `-k` | 仓颉 API Key | 环境变量 `CANGHE_API_KEY` |\n+| `--output` | `-o` | 输出路径 | `xiaohongshu-cover-{timestamp}.png` |\n+| `--size` | `-s` | 图片尺寸 | `1920x2560` |\n+\n+## 可用模型\n \n-1. Confirm the topic with the user if not clear\n-2. Check for API key (CANGHE_API_KEY environment variable or ask user to provide it)\n-3. Run the generation script with the topic\n-4. The image will be saved to the current working directory with filename format: `xiaohongshu-cover-{timestamp}.png`\n+### 推荐：Doubao Seedream 系列（免费，已配置）\n+\n+| 模型 ID | 说明 |\n+|---------|------|\n+| `doubao-seedream-5-0` | Seedream 5.0 最新版 ⭐ |\n+| `doubao-seedream-4-5` | Seedream 4.5 版 |\n+| `doubao-seedream-4-0` | Seedream 4.0 版 |\n+\n+### 仓颉 API（需 API Key）\n+\n+| 模型 ID | 说明 |\n+|---------|------|\n+| `canghe` | 仓颉默认模型（需 Key） |\n+\n+## 使用示例\n+\n+### 示例 1：用 Doubao Seedream 5.0 生成\n+```bash\n+python3 scripts/handler.py \"苹果紧急警告！4.2万台iPhone被入侵\" -m doubao-seedream-5-0\n+```\n \n-## Running the Script\n+### 示例 2：用 Seedream 4.5 生成（更快）\n+```bash\n+python3 scripts/handler.py \"副业干货分享\" -m doubao-seedream-4-5\n+```\n \n-The script is located at `scripts/handler.ts` and requires:\n-- Topic (required): The subject for the cover image\n-- API Key (required): Either via environment variable `CANGHE_API_KEY` or passed as argument\n+### 示例 3：用仓颉 API 生成\n+```bash\n+python3 scripts/handler.py \"今日穿搭分享\" -m canghe -k \"sk-xxx\"\n+```\n \n-Execute with:\n+或设置环境变量：\n ```bash\n-cd ~/.codebuddy/skills/xiaohongshu-cover-generator\n-npx tsx scripts/handler.ts \"<topic>\" \"<api-key-optional>\"\n+export CANGHE_API_KEY=\"sk-xxx\"\n+python3 scripts/handler.py \"今日穿搭分享\" -m canghe\n ```\n \n-Or with environment variable:\n+### 示例 4：自定义输出和尺寸\n ```bash\n-cd ~/.codebuddy/skills/xiaohongshu-cover-generator\n-CANGHE_API_KEY=\"your-api-key\" npx tsx scripts/handler.ts \"<topic>\"\n+python3 scripts/handler.py \"我的封面\" -o \"/root/my-cover.png\" -s \"1080x1440\"\n ```\n \n-## API Key\n+## 输出\n+\n+图片默认保存到：\n+- `/root/.openclaw/workspace/xiaohongshu-cover-{时间戳}.png`\n \n-Users need a valid API key from https://api.canghe.ai/\n+如指定路径，则保存到指定位置。\n \n-If the API key is missing or invalid, provide the user with clear instructions to obtain one.\n+## 默认设计风格\n \n-## Output\n+为获得最佳效果，建议在提示词开头加入以下设计风格前缀：\n \n-The generated image will be saved to **the directory where the skill was invoked** (current working directory), not the skill's directory. The filename format is `xiaohongshu-cover-{timestamp}.png` where timestamp is in milliseconds.\n+```\n+🎨 精美小红书封面设计，渐变背景，科技感图标装饰\n+```\n+\n+### 内容格式建议\n \n-## Style Specifications\n+每个内容项建议使用以下格式：\n+\n+```\n+🤖 标题名称\n+详细描述文字，说明功能价值，\n+可跨多行，增加用户吸引力\n+```\n \n-The generated images follow these specifications:\n-- Aspect ratio: 3:4 (vertical, mobile-friendly)\n-- Style: Clean, refined, youthful aesthetic\n-- Automatic removal of watermarks and logos\n-- High-quality output suitable for mobile viewing\n-- Text should be clear and readable with appropriate sizing\n+### 常用图标参考\n+\n+| 场景 | 推荐图标 |\n+|------|----------|\n+| AI相关 | 🤖 🧠 🚀 |\n+| 搜索发现 | 🔍 🎯 |\n+| 文档摘要 | 📝 📄 |\n+| 浏览器 | 🌐 💻 |\n+| 安全 | 🛡️ 🔒 |\n+| 邮件通讯 | 📧 📱 |\n+| 天气 | ☀️ 🌤️ |\n+| 定位 | 📍 🗺️ |\n+\n+## 注意事项\n+\n+1. **Doubao 模型**：已预配置 Ark API Key，免费使用\n+2. **仓颉 API**：需要 Key，无 Key 时可使用 Doubao 模型\n+3. **尺寸要求**：最小 3686400 像素（约 1920x1920）\n+4. **比例**：推荐 3:4 (1920x2560) 适合小红书\n+5. **精美设计**：使用设计风格前缀可获得更精美的背景效果\n+\n+## 推荐工作流\n+\n+1. 首选 `doubao-seedream-5-0`：效果最好\n+2. 如果5.0响应慢，用 `doubao-seedream-4-5`\n+3. 仓颉 API 作为备选\n+4. **重要**：使用\"🎨 精美小红书封面设计，渐变背景，科技感图标装饰\"前缀提升视觉效果\n\\ No newline at end of file\ndiff --git a/package.json b/package.json\nindex c4316be..ab792ea 100644\n--- a/package.json\n+++ b/package.json\n@@ -5,7 +5,7 @@\n   \"type\": \"module\",\n   \"main\": \"handler.ts\",\n   \"scripts\": {\n-    \"start\": \"tsx handler.ts\"\n+    \"start\": \"tsx scripts/handler.ts\"\n   },\n   \"keywords\": [\n     \"xiaohongshu\","}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":17,"aggregated":"diff --git a/SKILL.md b/SKILL.md\nindex 9b62c31..2037e85 100644\n--- a/SKILL.md\n+++ b/SKILL.md\n@@ -1,54 +1,124 @@\n ---\n name: xiaohongshu-cover-generator\n-description: Generate Xiaohongshu (小红书) style cover images based on user topics. Use when the user wants to create a social media cover image in Xiaohongshu style, or mentions keywords like \"小红书封面\", \"Xiaohongshu cover\", \"封面生成\", or provides a topic for cover image generation. The generated image will be saved to the current project directory.\n+description: 生成小红书风格封面图。支持两种生图方式：(1) Doubao Seedream 模型（需配置 Ark API），(2) 仓颉 API。用户可通过 --model 参数选择模型。当用户提到\"小红书封面\"\"配图生成\"\"封面图\"时触发。\n ---\n \n-# Xiaohongshu Cover Generator\n+# 小红书封面生成器\n \n-This skill generates Xiaohongshu-style cover images based on user-provided topics.\n+支持多种模型的 AI 封面图生成工具。\n \n-## Usage\n+## 使用方法\n \n-When a user requests a Xiaohongshu cover image:\n+```bash\n+# 进入技能目录\n+cd /root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/xiaohongshu-cover-generator\n+\n+# 生成封面图\n+python3 scripts/handler.py \"你的封面主题\" [选项]\n+```\n+\n+## 选项\n+\n+| 参数 | 简写 | 说明 | 默认值 |\n+|------|------|------|--------|\n+| `--model` | `-m` | 生图模型 | `doubao-seedream-5-0` |\n+| `--api-key` | `-k` | 仓颉 API Key | 环境变量 `CANGHE_API_KEY` |\n+| `--output` | `-o` | 输出路径 | `xiaohongshu-cover-{timestamp}.png` |\n+| `--size` | `-s` | 图片尺寸 | `1920x2560` |\n+\n+## 可用模型\n \n-1. Confirm the topic with the user if not clear\n-2. Check for API key (CANGHE_API_KEY environment variable or ask user to provide it)\n-3. Run the generation script with the topic\n-4. The image will be saved to the current working directory with filename format: `xiaohongshu-cover-{timestamp}.png`\n+### 推荐：Doubao Seedream 系列（免费，已配置）\n+\n+| 模型 ID | 说明 |\n+|---------|------|\n+| `doubao-seedream-5-0` | Seedream 5.0 最新版 ⭐ |\n+| `doubao-seedream-4-5` | Seedream 4.5 版 |\n+| `doubao-seedream-4-0` | Seedream 4.0 版 |\n+\n+### 仓颉 API（需 API Key）\n+\n+| 模型 ID | 说明 |\n+|---------|------|\n+| `canghe` | 仓颉默认模型（需 Key） |\n+\n+## 使用示例\n+\n+### 示例 1：用 Doubao Seedream 5.0 生成\n+```bash\n+python3 scripts/handler.py \"苹果紧急警告！4.2万台iPhone被入侵\" -m doubao-seedream-5-0\n+```\n \n-## Running the Script\n+### 示例 2：用 Seedream 4.5 生成（更快）\n+```bash\n+python3 scripts/handler.py \"副业干货分享\" -m doubao-seedream-4-5\n+```\n \n-The script is located at `scripts/handler.ts` and requires:\n-- Topic (required): The subject for the cover image\n-- API Key (required): Either via environment variable `CANGHE_API_KEY` or passed as argument\n+### 示例 3：用仓颉 API 生成\n+```bash\n+python3 scripts/handler.py \"今日穿搭分享\" -m canghe -k \"sk-xxx\"\n+```\n \n-Execute with:\n+或设置环境变量：\n ```bash\n-cd ~/.codebuddy/skills/xiaohongshu-cover-generator\n-npx tsx scripts/handler.ts \"<topic>\" \"<api-key-optional>\"\n+export CANGHE_API_KEY=\"sk-xxx\"\n+python3 scripts/handler.py \"今日穿搭分享\" -m canghe\n ```\n \n-Or with environment variable:\n+### 示例 4：自定义输出和尺寸\n ```bash\n-cd ~/.codebuddy/skills/xiaohongshu-cover-generator\n-CANGHE_API_KEY=\"your-api-key\" npx tsx scripts/handler.ts \"<topic>\"\n+python3 scripts/handler.py \"我的封面\" -o \"/root/my-cover.png\" -s \"1080x1440\"\n ```\n \n-## API Key\n+## 输出\n+\n+图片默认保存到：\n+- `/root/.openclaw/workspace/xiaohongshu-cover-{时间戳}.png`\n \n-Users need a valid API key from https://api.canghe.ai/\n+如指定路径，则保存到指定位置。\n \n-If the API key is missing or invalid, provide the user with clear instructions to obtain one.\n+## 默认设计风格\n \n-## Output\n+为获得最佳效果，建议在提示词开头加入以下设计风格前缀：\n \n-The generated image will be saved to **the directory where the skill was invoked** (current working directory), not the skill's directory. The filename format is `xiaohongshu-cover-{timestamp}.png` where timestamp is in milliseconds.\n+```\n+🎨 精美小红书封面设计，渐变背景，科技感图标装饰\n+```\n+\n+### 内容格式建议\n \n-## Style Specifications\n+每个内容项建议使用以下格式：\n+\n+```\n+🤖 标题名称\n+详细描述文字，说明功能价值，\n+可跨多行，增加用户吸引力\n+```\n \n-The generated images follow these specifications:\n-- Aspect ratio: 3:4 (vertical, mobile-friendly)\n-- Style: Clean, refined, youthful aesthetic\n-- Automatic removal of watermarks and logos\n-- High-quality output suitable for mobile viewing\n-- Text should be clear and readable with appropriate sizing\n+### 常用图标参考\n+\n+| 场景 | 推荐图标 |\n+|------|----------|\n+| AI相关 | 🤖 🧠 🚀 |\n+| 搜索发现 | 🔍 🎯 |\n+| 文档摘要 | 📝 📄 |\n+| 浏览器 | 🌐 💻 |\n+| 安全 | 🛡️ 🔒 |\n+| 邮件通讯 | 📧 📱 |\n+| 天气 | ☀️ 🌤️ |\n+| 定位 | 📍 🗺️ |\n+\n+## 注意事项\n+\n+1. **Doubao 模型**：已预配置 Ark API Key，免费使用\n+2. **仓颉 API**：需要 Key，无 Key 时可使用 Doubao 模型\n+3. **尺寸要求**：最小 3686400 像素（约 1920x1920）\n+4. **比例**：推荐 3:4 (1920x2560) 适合小红书\n+5. **精美设计**：使用设计风格前缀可获得更精美的背景效果\n+\n+## 推荐工作流\n+\n+1. 首选 `doubao-seedream-5-0`：效果最好\n+2. 如果5.0响应慢，用 `doubao-seedream-4-5`\n+3. 仓颉 API 作为备选\n+4. **重要**：使用\"🎨 精美小红书封面设计，渐变背景，科技感图标装饰\"前缀提升视觉效果\n\\ No newline at end of file\ndiff --git a/package.json b/package.json\nindex c4316be..ab792ea 100644\n--- a/package.json\n+++ b/package.json\n@@ -5,7 +5,7 @@\n   \"type\": \"module\",\n   \"main\": \"handler.ts\",\n   \"scripts\": {\n-    \"start\": \"tsx handler.ts\"\n+    \"start\": \"tsx scripts/handler.ts\"\n   },\n   \"keywords\": [\n     \"xiaohongshu\",","cwd":"/root/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1774401649719}}
