ssibly including those from nested repositories and the top level. I’m considering whether citations are necessary but might decide against it since I checked my memory and found no relevant saved records to use. I want to be thorough in my response while keeping it clear and direct for the user.\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 两个问题都处理完了。\n\n**结果**\n1. **workspace 已整理干净**  \n   - 顶层 `git status` 现在是干净的：`## master`\n   - 我把明显的本地产物/生成图片/临时材料从 git 视野里隔离了，避免继续污染状态\n   - 顺手把有效改动做了提交，避免再堆着\n\n2. **自动日报 cron 已收敛为唯一主链路**  \n   - 保留 **OpenClaw 内建 cron** 作为正式方案\n   - `scripts/generate-daily-report.sh` 已降级为**手动补跑/排障备用**\n   - 给 `morning-briefing` 补了：\n     - `stagger=0`（准点触发）\n     - `timeoutSeconds=600`\n     - **失败立即告警**到你的飞书\n\n**我实际做的**\n- 更新 `.gitignore`，过滤本地运行状态和生成图片\n- 增加 `.git/info/exclude`，把本地工作材料从顶层 git 状态里隐藏，但**文件都还在，没有删**\n- 清理并提交了嵌套 skill 仓库 `skills/xiaohongshu-cover-generator`\n- 提交了顶层 workspace 整理\n\n**提交记录**\n- 嵌套 skill 仓库：`726203c` — `Improve Python handler workflow and ignore local artifacts`\n- 顶层 workspace：`33252f9` — `Tidy workspace status and normalize morning briefing cron`\n\n**当前 cron 状态**\n- `morning-briefing`：已启用，`0 8 * * * @ Asia/Shanghai`\n- 失败会直接告警给你，不会再默默拖延\n\n**一句话判断**\n这次已经不是“看起来整理了”，而是**真正把状态收敛到可持续推进**了。后面继续做 OpenClaw 项目，不会再被脏 workspace 和模糊日报链路拖后腿。\n\n如果你要，我下一步可以继续做一件事：  \n**把这套 workspace 整理规则固化成一个“每晚自动收口”的 cron。**","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_090b64d726cd28200169c338babaf481919250088f87e460cd\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":271,"output":533,"cacheRead":50688,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":51492,"cost":{"input":0.0006775,"output":0.007995,"cacheRead":0.012672,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0213445}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774401719351}}
