{"type":"message","id":"361dd893","parentId":"b8c28f5f","timestamp":"2026-03-25T04:26:16.478Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Considering delivery options**\n\nI’m thinking about whether to announce without delivering something. It seems like creating a job is a good idea, but skipping the main summary might work too. It could streamline the process a bit. I feel like I’m weighing the pros and cons here. Is announcing enough, or does it need more context? I'll explore how these options play out as I move forward.","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_090b64d726cd28200169c363e156d48191bf927049bbebff0b\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABpw2PjGvuulDNTzVNd1iHvm1oiGTEkhlFX94u3__oG9CYT69c0FPmR1o6-4NE8toT6T8zU702O7Na6V2X8grJ0nYVN_izj7nJdJp6_vMkgCOZk1Qh5sOTj3sY8CbAoO18VjLj2UflsS58a024xl34mMkFIKIcvTKNNhzXvfor1zPwbDJh-HJQYC70bJqLSXFFPeloKtK9TM_C6HeZnCGSFqCEhiHdoWykF5k8vPby1PcLtjnEjEXzOi3NtpF1M1B-0VDr3i6Vz7pBFAKqPFCPZdAIES-cIGPMrGwGUepZ3eoJWnvkOBobY4abXTzK9M5bgq87ukYOcSGGHpQCqyIfVbt67Dp_giDwtrmh8J2F158iXFaTzJuJmVjbXEkcBSxIJzBRxF5r3ycdd3gdP2NLMpT3xwvAc-dYQYtNHqCynSLu1DBr_-bMhtytqoA6Q351hEp2YDHk1gQ7FvucNiqypeF4J_3fPAnPCVqUbycWi8wnE95HLwsOuLTMQROh82ybqfnpzOFoE6rth3-8xbyB8vj4cCbCV34Y9lWzdL_x7c6SCFxcDwd9eNs318IZhw_Yra4kNUhK-cBFbn9f-4BjprCK_L78dpEygVT8dEUlEZ0mt9WxtQ3Ftmy9atI6XtdWUYdQTFC4sadl5yZcR_8B9VVzqFuUJILARwQGtuRHT0wt4hFWpnmwUFLIdImnnTVTf9wSi5RkseG5p5wAw2W5aWwiM3PKVBJmdEHZH07YVTYSrlgLeVKw8_oCgKdIDBWxKEhtAz9e3RUwg5pCQ3T8DXSV5oiGc3MvFM39KDFWhAvkd_pMS8MOJmDUqwgwPG09BxafRjCOPeVEiWAiICKvUS8ZCxDNa9tO0dzf0pPDB_mrSzxJi5Fx-k4dT2FSczDTW-iYxcS8HlHCLnb3ix4q-RfTYgHJyJkIVj8w4cpTfUILIFTU=\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Considering delivery options**\\n\\nI’m thinking about whether to announce without delivering something. It seems like creating a job is a good idea, but skipping the main summary might work too. It could streamline the process a bit. I feel like I’m weighing the pros and cons here. Is announcing enough, or does it need more context? I'll explore how these options play out as I move forward.\"}]}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_lROaXMEAjmv7jfMomxUHQUYz|fc_090b64d726cd28200169c363e3b7c081919fcd53da13a6b2b4","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"openclaw cron add --name '每日晚间 workspace 收口' --cron '5 21 * * *' --tz 'Asia/Shanghai' --session isolated --exact --model 'arkcode/deepseek-v3.2' --timeout-seconds 480 --no-deliver --description '每日 21:05 自动做 workspace 收口：检查 git 状态、归类本地产物、记录阻塞；无异常不打扰，有异常再主动提醒。' --message '执行一次低打扰的 workspace 晚间收口。目标：保持 /root/.openclaw/workspace 可持续推进。步骤：1) 检查顶层 git status 与嵌套仓库状态；2) 识别明显的运行产物、临时文件、生成图片、日志、缓存、未归档草稿；3) 对低风险内容直接做收口：优先补充 .gitignore 或 .git/info/exclude、整理到合适目录、修正明显的 workspace 技术债；4) 如发现应提交但未提交的关键改动，做一次小而清晰的本地 git commit；5) 若涉及删除、对外发送、权限变化、高风险配置修改，则停止并不要执行；6) 无事则直接回复 NO_REPLY；7) 只有在出现会影响第二天推进的阻塞、失败或需要主人拍板的情况时，才发送简洁告警。默认结论先行，禁止流水账，禁止编造。'","workdir":"/root/.openclaw/workspace","yieldMs":10000},"partialJson":"{\"command\":\"openclaw cron add --name '每日晚间 workspace 收口' --cron '5 21 * * *' --tz 'Asia/Shanghai' --session isolated --exact --model 'arkcode/deepseek-v3.2' --timeout-seconds 480 --no-deliver --description '每日 21:05 自动做 workspace 收口：检查 git 状态、归类本地产物、记录阻塞；无异常不打扰，有异常再主动提醒。' --message '执行一次低打扰的 workspace 晚间收口。目标：保持 /root/.openclaw/workspace 可持续推进。步骤：1) 检查顶层 git status 与嵌套仓库状态；2) 识别明显的运行产物、临时文件、生成图片、日志、缓存、未归档草稿；3) 对低风险内容直接做收口：优先补充 .gitignore 或 .git/info/exclude、整理到合适目录、修正明显的 workspace 技术债；4) 如发现应提交但未提交的关键改动，做一次小而清晰的本地 git commit；5) 若涉及删除、对外发送、权限变化、高风险配置修改，则停止并不要执行；6) 无事则直接回复 NO_REPLY；7) 只有在出现会影响第二天推进的阻塞、失败或需要主人拍板的情况时，才发送简洁告警。默认结论先行，禁止流水账，禁止编造。'\",\"workdir\":\"/root/.openclaw/workspace\",\"yieldMs\":10000}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":830,"output":386,"cacheRead":49792,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":51008,"cost":{"input":0.002075,"output":0.00579,"cacheRead":0.012447999999999999,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.020312999999999998}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1