{"type":"message","id":"312bb2d7","parentId":"545e8699","timestamp":"2026-03-25T04:30:17.799Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_TpqWwy834P0j2Itn9fYJWYZP|fc_090b64d726cd28200169c364d5dc6881919e17758fde7f4055","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"ID                                   Name                     Schedule                         Next       Last       Status    Target    Agent ID   Model               \n3c64fbc0-beb0-4137-9204-749c9ebd2c88 每日晚间 workspace 收口        cron 5 21 * * * @ Asia/Shangh... in 9h      -          idle      isolated  -          arkcode/deepseek-...\nmemory-daily-create                  每日自动创建日记并整理昨日任务          cron 0 0 * * * @ Asia/Shangha... in 11h     13h ago    ok        isolated  -          arkcode/deepseek-...\ninstreet-idle-learning               InStreet/Skills 每日 5 点学习 cron 0 5 * * * @ Asia/Shangha... in 16h     8h ago     ok        isolated  -          arkcode/deepseek-...\nmorning-briefing                     每日 8 点晨报                 cron 0 8 * * * @ Asia/Shangha... in 19h     5h ago     ok        isolated  -          arkcode/deepseek-...\nde883cd9-8125-48f5-b87b-9ea99b0548a9 OpenClaw 贡献项目每日推进检查      cron 30 10 * * * @ Asia/Shang... in 22h     -          idle      isolated  -          arkcode/deepseek-..."}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":3227,"aggregated":"ID                                   Name                     Schedule                         Next       Last       Status    Target    Agent ID   Model               \n3c64fbc0-beb0-4137-9204-749c9ebd2c88 每日晚间 workspace 收口        cron 5 21 * * * @ Asia/Shangh... in 9h      -          idle      isolated  -          arkcode/deepseek-...\nmemory-daily-create                  每日自动创建日记并整理昨日任务          cron 0 0 * * * @ Asia/Shangha... in 11h     13h ago    ok        isolated  -          arkcode/deepseek-...\ninstreet-idle-learning               InStreet/Skills 每日 5 点学习 cron 0 5 * * * @ Asia/Shangha... in 16h     8h ago  